---
// HowItWorks section - 3-step horizontal timeline
---

<section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="how-header" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-heading">
        Empieza en <span class="gradient-text">tres pasos</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        No necesitas ser experto en finanzas. WalletWise está diseñado para que cualquiera pueda empezar en minutos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="how-steps" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <polyline points="17 11 19 13 23 9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Crea tu cuenta</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">Regístrate en segundos con tu email. Sin datos bancarios, sin complicaciones. Solo tú y tus finanzas.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/>
            <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Registra tus movimientos</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">Añade ingresos y gastos con categorías. Un par de clics y tu historial financiero empieza a tomar forma.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>3</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Toma el control</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">Visualiza tus patrones, detecta fugas de dinero y optimiza tus gastos con gráficos claros y estadísticas detalladas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .how-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .how-steps {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .step {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent), var(--color-cyan));
    color: #0f172a;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }

  .step-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .step:hover .step-icon {
    border-color: var(--color-border-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--color-glow);
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .step-connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 48px;
  }

  .connector-line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-border), var(--color-accent), var(--color-border));
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .how-steps {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .step {
      max-width: 320px;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
    }

    .step-connector {
      width: 2px;
      height: 40px;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .connector-line {
      width: 2px;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-border), var(--color-accent), var(--color-border));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .how {
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
